Owner: `nrz-cas`. Contract to deliver: The certified-membership kind/formal schema, pure rational enclosure/cut admission, expected-judgment replay and complete hypothesis/lemma citations; versioned wire/schema replacement when needed. Required verification and minimal failing case: Reject a certificate claiming `[−1,1]` lies in the positive region, a forged enclosure origin, escaped slot or widened region; independently replay positive twins and inspect all retained assumptions.

