Owner: `nrz-bindings`. Contract to deliver: Exact target/map/case correspondence, option/count domains, evidence attachment and immutable selected descriptor snapshots. Required verification and minimal failing case: Equal center bytes with a different source, unit map, case revision or parameter instance refuse; exact declared/CAS-proved counts bypass numerical decisions.

