Owner: `nrz-matrix`. Contract to deliver: Freeze and authenticate complete input/companion versions, prepare decisions through bindings, atomically publish attachments and invalidate all dependent results. Required verification and minimal failing case: Changing only the radius to cross a cut retires selection; foreign tickets, alias writes, failed publication and stale cache reuse refuse without a partial result.

