Owner: `nrz-bindings`, `nrz-matrix`, future `nrz-physics`. Contract to deliver: Declared interfaces and indexed templates, complete undecided handling, structural activation, ranks and transitive semantic dependency checks. Required verification and minimal failing case: A decision selecting the recipe that computes its own input refuses; an undeclared index, missing undecided consumer or count beyond materializable capacity cannot create a graph.

