Owner: future `nrz-physics`, `nrz-matrix`. Contract to deliver: Stable per-point outcome table, compatible stratum lowering and region sharing, preserved cross-point source/companion targets. Required verification and minimal failing case: The three-box sign batch retains its undecided middle row; a common-source mutation invalidates all dependents and equal branch labels never reuse a different point's certificate.

